    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The property was recently purchased and has undergone a complete refurbishment and now represents a modern, high end D6 apartment. Accommodation includes a large bright living room, separate, and extra large kitchen, 2 x double bedrooms an en suite bathroom and a master bathroom. Wooden floors throughout, neutral colour tone and modern fittings make this apartment a must see. Located in one of the most sought after neighbourhoods Dublin 6 has to offer, Rathgar Village is a very big draw. All amenities are on your doorstep including public transport. Available immediately the apartment is a must see."
      },
